  "notes": "Pay-as-you-go with per-token prices in USD per million tokens. Takes a standard Z.ai API key; a GLM Coding Plan key does not work here. Global region only. Caching is automatic, and cached storage is free for a limited time, so each model's cache write is set to its input price. The docs give every model here a 128K maximum output. Reasoning: the docs list only low, high and max as reasoning_effort values for GLM-5.3 and GLM-5.3-Flash, and no quirk maps the gateway's efforts onto them; this is untested live. No exhaustedErrorCodes: an insufficient balance answers HTTP 429 with code 1113, which is left as a Cooldown, since topping up the balance ends it at any time. Release dates come from models.dev.",
